# LF for every text file, in the repository and in each checkout.
* text=auto eol=lf

# iCalendar (RFC 5545) requires CRLF line endings, and folded content lines
# keep significant spaces: store every calendar byte for byte, without line-ending
# conversion. This covers the Vietnamese, English and minimal feeds alike.
*.ics -text whitespace=-blank-at-eol

*.zip binary
